.com/banners/movies/17949/posters/17949.jpg"},"seasons":{}}},"externalMedia":{"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":18283,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/18283","fetchedAt":"2026-11-14T17:50:01.010Z","originalLanguage":"en-US","title":{"value":"Brigadoon","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"Brigadoon","overview":{"value":"Jeff e Tommy, due americani in viaggio per la Scozia, si ritrovano in un villaggio incantato, Brigadoon, che appare dal nulla per un solo giorno ogni cent'anni, restando così preservato dal male. Tommy si innamora, ricambiato, di una fanciulla, ma il giorno magico finisce ed egli deve tornare a New York. Poi, però, l'amore lo riporta in Scozia, e, miracolosamente, Brigadoon riemerge dalle nebbie.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"The great Broadway stage musical hit is on the screen!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1954-09-08","status":"Released","rating":6.547,"ratingCount":181,"genres":["Musica","Fantasy","Romance"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"108m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":13294,"name":"Gene Kelly","role":"Tommy Albright","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g98yyY7oGrkocUxxJgOt82I7z6A.jpg"},{"id":37446,"name":"Van Johnson","role":"Jeff Douglas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A6vw5kbdmyXDz1ddQOocJmg9TSc.jpg"},{"id":41226,"name":"Cyd Charisse","role":"Fiona Campbell","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g5in2cxIlYimrD5bNYPeX6AkBb2.jpg"},{"id":121765,"name":"Elaine Stewart","role":"Jane Ashton","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rbMTE2NitqDD3fsfxxvS1O1xsP9.jpg"},{"id":48959,"name":"Barry Jones","role":"Mr. Lundie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7jJG65NAVWEHRhqRz9L4gAYmd3.jpg"},{"id":1324196,"name":"Hugh Laing","role":"Harry Beaton","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iq4VbU2RJwuP7VA1SPHyOVADOuv.jpg"},{"id":83783,"name":"Albert Sharpe","role":"Andrew Campbell","profile":"